        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Have you heard of Nessie? It’s the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Loch Ness Monster",
            "zh": "尼斯湖水怪"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Loch Ness is a lake in "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Scotland",
            "zh": "苏格兰"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It’s very large and deep. Many people think a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "monster",
            "zh": "怪物"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In the sixth century, a man said he saw a monster in the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". “Go back!” he shouted to it. He was safe. It was the first "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "report",
            "ref": "v-report"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of Nessie. In 1934, a photo of Nessie became famous. A doctor took the photo. But it "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "turned out",
            "ref": "v-turn-out"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to be "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "fake",
            "zh": "伪造的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Since then",
            "zh": "自那以后"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", there have been more reports of Nessie. Some people have tried to take photos and "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". But they are not very "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "clear",
            "ref": "v-clear"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Maybe it’s because Nessie is very shy. Some people even used "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "sonar",
            "zh": "声呐"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "scan",
            "zh": "扫描"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the lake "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". But they didn’t "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " Nessie, either."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "So, what have people seen in Loch Ness? Maybe the monster is just a giant "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "eel",
            "zh": "鳗鱼"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", a "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " bird, a tree or a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "seal",
            "ref": "v-seal"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Some people think it could be a dinosaur. What do you think?"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
